<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24">
    <p class="text-fg-muted text-xs mb-6">Last updated: August 3, 2026</p>
    <h1 class="text-fg text-2xl font-medium mb-12">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>
                Maple is operated by Makisuo, Inc. ("we", "us", "our"). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect,
                use, and protect information when you use the Maple observability platform and related services
                (the "Service").
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <h3 class="text-fg text-sm font-medium mb-2">Account Information</h3>
            <p class="mb-3">
                When you create an account, we collect your name, email address, and authentication credentials.
                Authentication is handled by Clerk, a third-party authentication provider.
            </p>
            <h3 class="text-fg text-sm font-medium mb-2">Telemetry Data</h3>
            <p class="mb-3">
                The Service ingests OpenTelemetry data (traces, logs, and metrics) that you send from your
                applications. This data is owned by you and processed solely to provide the Service.
            </p>
            <h3 class="text-fg text-sm font-medium mb-2">Usage Data</h3>
            <p class="mb-3">
                We collect basic usage information such as page views, feature usage, and performance metrics
                to improve the Service. We use our own product to do this: our website and dashboard run the
                Maple browser SDK, and this data is stored in our own systems rather than shared with a
                third-party analytics provider.
            </p>
            <p>
                This includes a sampled recording of page interactions (clicks, navigation, and console or
                network errors) so we can diagnose problems. Text entered into form fields is masked before it
                leaves your browser and is never recorded. See
                <a href="#cookies" class="text-fg underline underline-offset-2">Cookies and Similar Technologies</a>
                for how to opt out.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5">
                <li>To provide and maintain the Service</li>
                <li>To authenticate your identity and manage your account</li>
                <li>To process and display your telemetry data</li>
                <li>To send service-related communications</li>
                <li>To improve the Service and develop new features</li>
                <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">4. Data Retention</h2>
            <p>
                Telemetry data is retained according to your plan's retention period. Account information is
                retained for as long as your account is active. You may request deletion of your account and
                associated data at any time by contacting us.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">5. Data Security</h2>
            <p>
                We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data, including encryption
                in transit (TLS) and at rest. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure,
                and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">6. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">We use the following third-party services to operate the platform:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5">
                <li><strong class="text-fg">Clerk</strong> — Authentication and user management</li>
                <li><strong class="text-fg">Tinybird</strong> — Analytics data processing and storage</li>
                <li><strong class="text-fg">OpenTelemetry</strong> — Telemetry data collection standard</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">
                Each third-party service has its own privacy policy governing their handling of data.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">7. Your Rights</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">You have the right to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5">
                <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
                <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
                <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
                <li>Export your telemetry data</li>
                <li>Withdraw consent for data processing</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="cookies">
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">8. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">
                We use essential cookies for authentication and session management. We do not use
                third-party advertising cookies, and we do not sell or share this data with advertisers.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-3">
                We also set one first-party analytics identifier, <code class="text-fg">maple_visitor</code>,
                stored as a cookie and in your browser's local storage. It is a random identifier — it contains
                no name, email, or address — and it lets us count unique visitors and understand which pages
                lead people to sign up. Because it is scoped to <code class="text-fg">maple.dev</code>, it is
                shared between our website and our dashboard so that both count as the same visit rather than
                two. It expires after 13 months.
            </p>
            <p>
                We honor the
                <a
                    href="https://globalprivacycontrol.org/"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="text-fg underline underline-offset-2">Global Privacy Control</a
                >
                signal: if your browser or extension sends it, we do not set this identifier, and any copy already
                stored is deleted. Clearing your cookies and site data removes it as well.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes
                by posting a notice on the Service or sending you an email.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-fg text-base font-medium mb-3">10. Contact</h2>
            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at
                <a href="mailto:privacy@getmaple.dev" class="text-fg underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary transition-colors">privacy@getmaple.dev</a>.
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>
